MODULE: TypeOKCauseOutsideDomain
TARGET: TypeOK
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: environment injects a cause outside the classifier vocabulary
PERTURBS: CauseOn

--- FIND
    /\ input' = [input EXCEPT ![t] = [causes |-> cs, partition |-> p,
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: corrupt the observed cause vocabulary.
    /\ input' = [input EXCEPT ![t] = [causes |-> cs \cup {"Unknown"}, partition |-> p,
--- END
